# Crops and renders made while checking a scan against the catalogue are throwaway --
# they are reproducible from the masters in one sharp() call. Scripts here are tracked.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp

# The finished rewrite is the only copy of that work until it is applied to
# museum-data.json and the workbook; the root *.json credential rule would
# otherwise leave it untracked. Narrow on purpose -- credentials stay ignored.
!rewrites.json
